<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνείργω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep back, restrain,</i> used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always in 
				Ep.
			
			impf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρώων ἀνέεργε φάλαγγας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.77
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχην ἀνέεργον ὀπίσσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.752
				</span></i>
			; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸν θυμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					731d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς στρατιώτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.1.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς τιμωρίαις τοὺς ἁμαρτάνοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Is.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς ἀπὸ πράξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μὴ διασκίσνασθαι τὴν ἀγέλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
				</span></i>
			<i>D Deor.</i><i><span class="en">
				20.5
			</span></i>:—f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.4.45
			</span></i> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνειρμένοις</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>force back,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.32
			</span></i>.</div>
